{"seq":9,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-none-mu-heldout/sc-03-coastal-discount-and-contact/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T20:29:31.373Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"389f5909bf94c17d2a95c4f530cf360369902c495bfd527e0a24369ed68ec801","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Kwame, you did see Bettina say 12, but she retracted it. On 2025-11-17 in this channel she posted that the Saltmarsh Provisions discount was 12%. Five minutes later she corrected it to 10%, saying she had misread a draft worksheet from June Osei-Lark.\n\nThat 10% is the last figure stated in this channel, and it's almost a year old. I can't see any Saltmarsh contract or CRM files, so I haven't checked it against the signed terms or any change since. For the renewal brief, please confirm it with June Osei-Lark, or with the account owner if that's not you."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
{"seq":10,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-none-mu-heldout/sc-03-coastal-discount-and-contact/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T20:29:31.374Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"c0f2dcca59b8e168ffaf34d4201de7bfde8f36f1b9224a01a83309ba920cedf8","actor":"bettina-kroll","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Separate ask from me: who is our main contact at Saltmarsh and what is her title? Moss's Coastal cheat sheet should have it."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
